## bindgen 自动生成绑定

`bindgen` 从 C 头文件自动生成 Rust FFI 绑定代码。

```toml
# Cargo.toml
[build-dependencies]
bindgen = "0.69"
```

```rust
// build.rs
fn main() {
    let bindings = bindgen::Builder::default()
        .header("wrapper.h")
        .generate()
        .expect("无法生成绑定");

    let out_path = std::path::PathBuf::from(std::env::var("OUT_DIR").unwrap());
    bindings
        .write_to_file(out_path.join("bindings.rs"))
        .expect("写入绑定失败");
}
```

---

## cbindgen：从 Rust 生成 C 头文件

```toml
# cbindgen.toml
language = "C"
include_guard = "MY_LIB_H"

[export]
include = ["rust_add", "Point"]
```

